# FoodLens AI - environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in your own values. `.env` is gitignored; never commit
# real values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT values (shipped inside the app binary)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build
# time, so ONLY put values here that are safe for anyone to read.
#
# The Supabase URL and anon key are designed to be public: on their own they
# grant nothing, because every table is protected by Row Level Security.
#
# Find both at: Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER values (NEVER put these in this file or in the app)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The keys below must only ever exist as Supabase Edge Function secrets. They
# are listed here as documentation of what the server needs, NOT as variables
# to fill in locally.
#
# Set them with:
#   supabase secrets set VISION_API_KEY=...
#   supabase secrets set USDA_FDC_API_KEY=...
#
#   VISION_API_KEY        Key for the vision-capable AI provider.
#   VISION_MODEL          Model identifier to call.
#   USDA_FDC_API_KEY      USDA FoodData Central key (free, see docs/SETUP.md).
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#                         Injected automatically into Edge Functions by
#                         Supabase. Do not set it by hand, and never ship it.
#
# If you ever paste a service role key or a provider key into a file with an
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix, treat it as leaked and rotate it immediately.
